title: "Torch Floating Point: a PyTorch library for custom floating-point formats with automatic differentiation"
abstract: A PyTorch library that rounds tensors onto a user-chosen IEEE-style floating-point codebook, with a straight-through estimator, CPU/CUDA kernels, and block-scaled Round for OCP MX and NVFP4.
